- Keep the bottom action bar height stable on short and final screens.
- Keep the Tauri window responsive while the privileged install runs.
- Move blocking process and pipe handling to Tauri's blocking task pool.
- Never present zram, RAM disks, swap devices, or normal loop devices as
  installation destinations.
- Keep disposable loop-device testing behind an explicit test-only opt-in.
- Fit and recenter the installer when the VM display resolution changes.
- Keep the wizard footer reachable on short screens with a compact layout.
- Enable the standard minimize and maximize window controls.

